00:01:04.321 --> 00:01:06.868
What's the matter sweetie,
don't cry Santa's fun!

00:01:09.072 --> 00:01:10.535
- Let me wiggle your tooth.

00:01:10.535 --> 00:01:12.374
- [Child] No mommy no!

00:01:12.374 --> 00:01:13.363
- Come on, let me, come on.

00:01:13.363 --> 00:01:14.158
Let me see it.
- [Child] No mommy!

00:01:14.158 --> 00:01:15.592
